{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:45 2026-09-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:32 2026-09-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:32 2026-09-09 HKT</p><p>今日（9日）早上11時34分，警方接獲灣仔菲林明道12至14號一間便利店的職員報案，指店內有收銀機及財物被一名男子毀壞，對方逃去。人員趕到，在附近兜截未有發現涉案男子，列作刑事毀壞跟進。</p><p>警員調查期間，便利店職員見有記者採訪，一度拉閘暫停營業。人員初步相信涉案的年約40歲男子在購物排隊付款時，疑不滿等候太久，發難用罐裝飲品擊打收銀機及貨架後逃去。店方經點算，收銀機和兩包煙損毀，損失共值約600元。</p><img alt=\"警員在便利店調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/dfd0136164e4b5cb2700da8754fdc5f2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_12_12_01_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/65efa76dad0fe08d9ee62964f7ef6f4f/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_12_12_01.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/754178753715a894a0e9da25df20e242/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_12_11_59_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在店內調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/924ca8ed596eb785cf6bf1e8fb865e24/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_12_12_00_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/830f2aa335942599ba4491627a72ce7d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_12_12_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是灣仔菲林明道12至14號。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/76324e3b8d77b36daa7289514853edce/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_12_11_59.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ea996262bda5ea9366bd2b94c5cbc8ef/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_12_11_58_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/75e64b8f461498b4aa1abd838e5797e1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_12_11_58.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T06:19:27.637284+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}